## MANPAD teams revised (Lateralus 19 Nov 2026 12:4x PST, thread 1572962048705429598: "Osama underpriced the Chinese MANPAD teams and misconfigured them" / "You also forgot some infantry")
- Team list now = every infantry card in the Arsenal (Infantry and Recon tabs) carrying a MANPAD: adds Spetsnaz GRU Mix 85->70, Spetsnaz GRU AA 85->75, STT 65->60 (floor = Pararescue 60, option +5 -> +0), Air Defense Scouts 防空侦察 60->50, BARS Igla 60->50, Sea Dragons 蛟龙 65->55. GRU option costs: AA +0 -> +5, AT +15 -> +30 (GRU AT stays 100).
